      {
        "text": "And when they found them not, they drew Jason and certain brethren unto the rulers of the city, crying, These that have turned the world upside down are come hither also;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 17:6",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Whom Jason hath received: and these all do contrary to the decrees of Cæsar, saying that there is another king, one Jesus.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 112,
            "end": 115
          }
