        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And they troubled the people and the rulers of the city, when they heard these things.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 17:8",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And when they had taken security of Jason, and of the other, they let them go.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 17:9",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And the brethren immediately sent away Paul and Silas by night unto Berea: who coming thither went into the synagogue of the Jews.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 86,
            "end": 93
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 17:10",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "These were more noble than those in Thessalonica, in that they received the word with all readiness of mind, and searched the scriptures daily, whether those things were so.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 113,
            "end": 121,
            "text": "TG Scriptures, Study of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
